Z||000023||theogre||12-25-2001||11:56 AM||||I strongly recomend reading the info on U.S. copyright at <A HREF="http://www.loc.gov" TARGET=_blank>www.loc.gov</A>. Everything you need is there.<P>In many ways copyright is really straight forward but when it comes to "work for hire" and licensing, things get really messy fast.<P>You can't just ask in a forum like this... If a release is needed, you need to do the correct paperwork or the release may not holdup.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 12-25-2001).]||||reg||1
